17. AWS S3 Example Using Dictionary
Imagine we want to store information about an S3 file.
s3_file = {    "bucket_name": "company-raw-data",    "file_name": "customers.csv",    "record_count": 1000,    "status": "SUCCESS"}
print(s3_file["bucket_name"])
print(s3_file["file_name"])
print(s3_file["record_count"])
print(s3_file["status"])
Output
company-raw-data
customers.csv
1000
SUCCESS
